<title>UK: Die Westhyp sets 1.0 bln mark December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Die Westhyp sets 1.0 bln mark December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers DG Bank Frankfurt, Commerzbank, Dresdner Bank and Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DIE WESTHYP</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    19.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.855    PAY DATE  S-19.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    =	   S- SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.215     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBREIF EMISSION 3772</p>
